<title>ROMANIA: Clinton arrives in Bucharest for day-long visit.</title>
<headline>Clinton arrives in Bucharest for day-long visit.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. President Bill Clinton arrived in Bucharest on Friday for a day-long visit to encourage Romanians to pursue reforms and persist in their bid for NATO membership.</p>
<p>Clinton arrived aboard Air Force One at 11.15 a.m. (0815 GMT) at Bucharest's Otopeni airport and was met by Prime Minister Victor Ciorbea. The highlight of his eight-hour stay will be an address to Romanians in a central Bucharest square.</p>
